      "default": "INSTANCE_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED",
      "description": "InstanceStatus represents the lifecycle state of a managed gateway instance.\n\n - INSTANCE_STATUS_PAUSED: Paused by the instance-limit flow: traffic refused, everything kept.\nOnly ResumeInstance leaves it. See docs/design/instance-over-limit.md."
